{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33300","headline":"长城 · 于濆","name":"长城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦皇岂无德，蒙氏非不武。\n岂将版筑功，万里遮胡虏。\n团沙世所难，作垒明知苦。\n死者倍堪伤，僵屍犹抱杵。\n十年居上郡，四海谁爲主。\n纵使骨爲尘，冤名不入土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}